    {
      "cn_text": "然而，这些研究最终却以「霍桑效应」命名，这一极具影响力的观点认为，仅仅是被实验本身这一行为就改变了实验对象的行为表现。",
      "en_text": "Instead, the studies ended up giving their name to the “Hawthorne effect”, the extremely influential idea that the very act of being experimented upon changed subjects’ behavior.",
